---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Ubuhanga"
  description="Privacy Policy for Ubuhanga — how we collect, use, and protect your data."
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="legal-hero__label">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="legal-hero__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-hero__subtitle">Last updated: June 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We collect minimal information necessary to operate the Platform. This may include:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Account information:</strong> If you sign in with Google to post comments, we
            collect your name and email address from your Google profile.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Comments:</strong> Any text you submit as a comment is stored along with your
            display name.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Newsletter:</strong> If you subscribe, we collect your name and email address.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics to understand usage patterns. This
            collects anonymized data such as pages visited, browser type, and device information.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide and maintain the Platform</li>
          <li>Display comments on videos</li>
          <li>Send newsletter updates (if subscribed)</li>
          <li>Analyze usage to improve our content</li>
          <li>Serve relevant advertisements via Google AdSense</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We use the following third-party services:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Firebase (Google):</strong> Authentication, Firestore database, and hosting. See
            <a href="https://firebase.google.com/support/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Firebase Privacy Policy</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Analytics:</strong> Usage analytics. See
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google AdSense:</strong> Advertising. See
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>YouTube:</strong> Embedded video content. See
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Vercel:</strong> Hosting and deployment. See
            <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vercel Privacy Policy</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
        <p>
          Your data is stored securely on Firebase (Google Cloud Platform). We implement reasonable
          security measures to protect your information. However, no method of transmission or
          storage is 100% secure.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your data (comments, newsletter subscription)</li>
          <li>Unsubscribe from the newsletter at any time</li>
          <li>Opt out of Google Analytics by using the
            <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          We use cookies for authentication (admin session) and analytics. Google AdSense may also
          use cookies for personalized advertising. You can control cookie preferences through your
          browser settings.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page
          with an updated "Last updated" date.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at
          <a href="https://techinika.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Techinika.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
    background: var(--color-surface-warm);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-hero__label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-amber-700);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .legal-hero__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-hero__subtitle {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .legal-section {
    padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--color-amber-700);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
    }
    .legal-section {
      padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .legal-content a {
      color: var(--color-amber-400);
    }
  }
</style>
